BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      This exchange continued through many seasons. Sometimes the River Spirit's blessing seemed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (         stronger or weaker, and the amounts appeared uncertain across the waters. Yet the chief) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (        s persisted, understanding that small misunderstandings were part of the river's nature.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      The villages learned that prosperity flows from trust, like water seeking water. When one ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (        gives freely and the other returns fairly, both shores flourish. Those who hoard or betr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (        ay wither, while those who cooperate thrive together.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      Thus the wisdom: *Trust creates abundance that cannot exist alone.*) Tj ET
