BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      # The Tale of the Golden River) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      In ancient times, there lived two villages separated by a barren valley. The Sun Goddess g) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (        ave each village a gift: the Upstream Village received five golden seeds each dawn, whil) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        e the Downstream Village received nothing but dry earth.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
