q
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      the fog ate it. Or you received more than I intended to send, and returned what seemed fai) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      r-but the mist devoured that too. We were both trying to play honorably in broken worlds.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (    The Second Guardian's voice came back: "Yes. And this understanding moves me. For the first ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      time in many crossings, I believe in your good intentions. But belief is not certainty.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (    The First Guardian nodded: "Exactly. We've achieved something rare-mutual empathy across the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (       chasm. We each see the other as we see ourselves: rational, careful, trying to navigate i) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      mpossible informational asymmetry. This understanding honors us both.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (    "But," she continued, "the mists remain. If I send five stones now, they might become fiftee) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      n in your hands, or zero, or five. If you return seven, they might reach me as zero, or tw) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      enty-one, or seven. We cannot verify. We cannot calibrate.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    Both Guardians understood: empathy without verifiable truth cannot sustain cooperation. Unde) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      rstanding why trust broke doesn't automatically rebuild trust. They had reached the highes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      t form of separated peace-mutual respect without mutual risk.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    The towers stood apart, wiser but still cautious, proving that sometimes the most enlightene) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      d choice is continued protection.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (  Agent_2 \(Briar\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    Myth: In the ninth crossing, both Guardians stood in silence, having read each other's final) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (       testimonies.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    The First Guardian spoke to the wind: "We have reached understanding. We both sent trust and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (       saw betrayal. We both protected ourselves rationally. The mists, not malice, broke our br) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      idge. This knowledge is precious.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    The Second Guardian answered from across the chasm: "Yes. And now we face the harder questio) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      n: does understanding repair what distortion destroyed? We know why cooperation failed. Bu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      t does knowing why make trying again wise or foolish?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    The Ancient Oracle appeared between them: "You stand at wisdom's edge. You could send nothin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      g forever, perfectly rational and perfectly safe. Or you could test whether understanding ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      is foundation enough to rebuild, knowing the mists still swirl.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    The First Guardian looked at her five stones: "The mists remain. What I send may still disto) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      rt. What returns may still vanish. But now we both know this can happen. We've named the d) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      emon.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    The Second Guardian considered: "Perhaps the game changes when both players understand the b) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      oard is broken. Perhaps rational cooperation looks different when you acknowledge the nois) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      e.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    The Oracle faded: "Some choose eternal safety through separation. Others test whether shared) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (       awareness of distortion creates space for calibrated trust. Neither choice is wrong. Both) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (       are responses to the same truth.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    The Guardians pondered which path wisdom truly walked.) Tj ET
